      "content": "2000-3000mg feels a bit low for what i'm trying to achieve though. i want to really blast these stones out. i was reading some stuff that said super high doses, like 10,000mg or even more, can act like a massive flush for the kidneys. is there any real danger in going much higher than 3000mg to make sure the cleanse actually works? especially with the calcium oxalate issues i have?",
